+#if PLATFORM(WASM)
+// browser-lite: the engine thread learns the scroll position of the scrolling thread only with its
+// rendering updates, which a busy page spaces out (long scripts): in a fling the view ran away from
+// the tiles. Like Chrome's skewport (and the velocity based tile coverage of WebKit on iOS), the
